The repository copies normalize the missing final newline only. Resulting
SHA-256 values are fd083c9bf1f5c35c19db9e8e93201449fa728abb790a1f8ba7ada16ce99ae380
for yxml.c and 2d87b37ee9cd819df3eabf93b38fd1efce3df6810062971aa0bbf4aeabb73508
for yxml.h.

The originally planned commit 6bc21882f4667ed10797472f85cfe2cf2ccdaee6
incorrectly reported opening element names as YXML_ELEMEND. Upstream commit
d41923630fcf70c6e2181722d9d087dd1aa3b530 is the official corrective commit
("Fix incorrect reporting of ELEMSTART as ELEMEND").

